        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dkartzinel/{size}/2252_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-10-14T23:26:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hmm, I think for the first one, you’re correct, Shielding winds would not prevent any damage since Fortitude reduced the damage.</p>\n<p>For the second one, I think shielding winds and the latter half of undaunted would happen, it’s an either/or situation, so I don’t think you would then get to apply the first half of undaunted.</p>",
